{"server":"cn","storyId":"act39side_level_act39side_03_end","groupId":"act39side","stageId":"act39side_03","title":"大出血的舞步","storyCode":"EP-3","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act39side/level_act39side_03_end.txt","sourceHash":"607b914ecf2cce4a24072f18e76645978c061a058390acffdb790a3655715986","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"胡安娜拼死杀死了巨大的盐鳞，但埋伏在半路的安纳斯塔西奥与西尔弗夺走了这珍贵的物资。勉强逃回营地，船员们逐渐接纳了一直帮助他们的棘刺。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g4_newdeck_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心，别往蒸汽柱上撞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，大言不惭说要领着我们往里闯，这就是你的办法吗？把我们所有人弄死在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉......我下次会注意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"伊西多投出的试管在空气中炸裂，淡金色的雾气随之散开。\n很快，几人便清晰地看见一道微弱的赤色气流冲开雾气。\n紧随其后的，是剧烈的蒸汽喷发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样我们就能预知蒸汽喷发了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我手里这种药剂剩的不多了，不够支撑我们行进太远......快点划吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g4_newdeck_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈维尔，前面有船只残骸，注意行驶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果需要，我可以用药剂爆破掉它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用不着，我能避开。你多能干我已经知道了，小子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......好。这沉船......看起来有些年头了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我认识它，胡安娜设计的最初版盐船，她带上大家，以为可以驾驶着它穿过骸礁峡谷，回到海洋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她失败了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也失去了很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小子，看到首领的踪迹了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看得到，离得不远了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"盐船继续向前行驶，掠过一片高耸的骨刺，几道裂痕贯穿骨刺表面，沾染了大量血液。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别乱想，那是盐鳞血。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"伊西多捡起从崖壁上滚落的碎盐块，扔了出去。\n然后，他摊开黏腻的手掌，看到手中满是从盐块上沾来的血迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是怎样的一场搏杀，一路上几乎都是血迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首领她......还活着吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"答案就在前面了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g1_saltdesert_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"绕过峡谷间的骸骨巨柱，可以看到巨大的盐鳞尸体横在地上，早已没了气息，一把舵轮正插在它的脑袋上。\n而舵轮的主人趴在盐鳞的背上，一动不动，血液顺着她的脚慢慢滑下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夫人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡安娜......不......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"所有人走下船，攀上盐鳞的背。哈维尔轻轻触碰女人的胳臂，她的身体尚存温热，却令他更觉悲伤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，是我们来晚了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳......咳咳，你们来得确实太晚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女、女士？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我还指望你们能早点来搭把手呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夫人，你还好吗？我们看到你浑身都是血......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别担心，身上的血不是我的，是这大家伙的。它挣扎了一路，还是没能撑到最后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊西多，可以把水壶递给我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_i03"},{"type":"narration","text":"接过水壶，胡安娜缓缓爬下盐鳞的背，然后倚靠着它巨大的身躯坐下。\n她扒开塞子，痛饮几口，看看围过来的众人，嘴角噙着一丝笑意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咸鳞汁啊......可惜。如果是壶上好的朗姆酒就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"伊西多......你能来扶我一把吗？和这大家伙拼斗这么久，我累得根本站不起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我来吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，还是让那小家伙来，你们得把这头盐鳞切开来带回去呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小哈，顺便帮我把舵轮从盐鳞身上取下来吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没问题，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"过来，小家伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好......好的，我来扶你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦，慢着，等候一位女士可不能太心急，最起码要等她把手头的事情做完。"},{"type":"narration","text":"将壶塞丢到空中抛接几次，胡安娜不紧不慢地喝干壶里的液体，而一旁的伊西多只能耐心等待。\n胡安娜的喉头一滚一滚，她吞咽得很缓慢。\n或者说，她吞咽得很费劲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）为什么不告诉他们你受伤了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）扣住我的腰，撑稳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）嘶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）听着，小家伙，我不能受伤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）最近，船队里......人心惶惶，我不能向船员们展示......自己软弱的一面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）你刚为他们猎到了接下来一整个月的食物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）他们该照顾你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）我当然不担心他们会背叛我。只是......如果我倒下，他们只会觉得现状危急，然后陷入慌乱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）所以，请扶好我......我不想当着所有人的面摔倒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）嘶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）可你肋骨有断裂，我不能用力扶你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）我受得住......没关系。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g1_saltdesert_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"习武教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"证裁官阁下，有一艘盐船正从西南方向驶来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来他们满载而归了，船后面拖的可是条大家伙啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您要看看吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我去给教士们下进攻信号。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"西尔弗高举望远镜，圆形的玻璃镜片中，一面绘着骷髅头的旗帜在风沙中摆动。\n在盐漠生活这么久，他从未如此期盼见到它。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g11_meetingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我清点过了，除去每人额定的配给，我们还剩下很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，这样修复罗盘也能有充足的材料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的事情就交给我吧，苦战一番，想必您已经疲惫不堪，还是早点去休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也好，事情交给你我信得过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要我扶您回房间吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快去做你的事吧。我只是累了，又不是断手断脚，扶什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g3_newdeck_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小子，问你件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂奇女士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首领没有受伤吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您为什么这么问？胡安娜女士并无大碍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？小子，你要是说谎我可饶不了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您很担心吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，女士从来不在众人面前示弱，我这一辈子没见过几次她受伤......却总能在她身上看到新的伤疤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想她受伤瞒着我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......她不会有事的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g1_saltdesert_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"习武教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目标进入射程！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"动手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g11_meetingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"窗外的惨叫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔呃——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可恶，是审判庭的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的舵轮在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们必然是冲着猎物来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可您不是......让我去！您就在船舱里等我们的消息，好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把我的猎物拱手让给审判庭？不，绝不可能。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡安娜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡安娜！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g3_newdeck_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你向我保证......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"走神的船员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有埋伏！快找掩护！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死，是审判庭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想知道，八成是有些被抓的软骨头把我们捕猎的路线泄露出去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1592_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂奇！那些混账是冲着我们的猎物来的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说点我不知道的！负责看守鳞肉的家伙呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1592_1","isRemote":false,"text":"袭击来得太突然，他们来不及应战，死的死，伤的伤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让他们撤回来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那盐鳞怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人比肉重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"全速前进，拉开距离！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是你们的人......我去查看盐鳞的情况。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g1_saltdesert_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"躲避不及的船员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1592_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"习武教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看守盐鳞的人已经清理完了。我们割断了绳子，他们拖不走这些鳞肉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的海盗呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"习武教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已经退回船舱里躲着了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜......要是我们人再多些，拿下那条船应该也不在话下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"执裁官阁下呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"习武教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去追击逃跑的人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让他回来。盐鳞已经到手，不必再追。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"习武教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大人——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"巨大的舵轮向西尔弗飞来，他急忙向后躲闪，差点一个踉跄摔在地上。\n从盐船上跃下一个黑衣女人，等她站定，空中飞过的舵轮又回到她手中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"审判庭的，你带着我的猎物想去哪里啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你就是那个腐化人心的阿戈尔人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你啊，小西尔弗......还以为你当了证裁官能有多大长进，现在看来，你和你那背信弃义的前任也没什么差别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"永远只会些背后捅刀子的法子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道我还要礼待罪人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那我对你们，是不是也只要用刀剑说话就够了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妄以为弑杀执掌正义之人，自己就能接管正义？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怪不得敢进盐漠了，这是找到靠山了，西尔弗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"执裁官阁下，那女人就是海盗的首领。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么你便是盗窃罗盘的背后主使......告诉我，罗盘此刻是否在你手中？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又因那罗盘......萌生出了怎样可怖的欲望？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（糟了，牵动到伤口......躲不过去！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你疯了吗？他差点就射中你了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）闭嘴，小家伙，你以为我不想躲开吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们得撤回船里，那家伙很强，现在不是对付他的时候。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你也在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你也一起受审判。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快走！再不走就来不及了......他们准备充足，而我们才刚经历过一场恶战！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不帮忙就滚回去，小家伙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂奇刚刚下了全速行驶的命令！留在这里你会被落下的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盐船要尽快甩开他们！我们没时间等你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你就回去，小子。"},{"type":"narration","text":"胡安娜想要坚持站立，但却发现自己根本提不起力气。\n她看到渐渐包围过来的执裁官和习武教士，更远处，西尔弗高傲地踩着她的猎物。\n那是船队接下来一个月的食物，是修复罗盘的材料来源之一。\n为了重返海洋，她不能失去它。\n“胡安娜女士！回来！”\n胡安娜听见有人在船尾呼唤她，那是哈维尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小子，快点抓住绳梯！带胡安娜一起回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血......胡安娜你的伤口崩开了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事！快上来！"},{"type":"narration","text":"她还不能昏迷，她的船员需要她，她要带领船队去往的未来还没有达成。\n她给科鲁兹的承诺还没有兑现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别让他们跑了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"习武教士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡安娜女士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"胡安娜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"胡安娜夫人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别......吵了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"终于，她再也支撑不住，任由疼痛与混沌接管自己的神智。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g11_meetingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡安娜女士，你醒了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我们安全回来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"痛......蒂奇在哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂奇在忙其他事，这里有我在，我陪在您的身边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个小家伙呢......他去哪里了？他跑掉了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，是他把您带回来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您要见他吗，我可以现在去找......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他在做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈维尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......和蒂奇一起，照顾在围剿中受伤的船员。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g10_community_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的船员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊啊——痛——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，这药剂直接敷有点刺激性，但马上就能止血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快闭嘴吧，少花点力气喊痛了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的船员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......你敷......我忍住......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那边情况怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沉重地摇头）他们受伤太重......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死去的人记得尽快埋进盐漠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......小子，跟我来一趟，塞斯克要见你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞斯克，他也受伤了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，他被射中肝脏，出了很多血，就留着一口气，说要见你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在哪里......带我去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g10_community_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"端着一碗滚烫的肉汤，伊西多试图在挤攘的伤员中穿行。\n在诸多惨白无神的面孔中，伊西多看到了一个熟悉的家伙，正有气无力地冲他挤出一个笑容。\n他坐到那家伙的旁边，回了一个笑容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你笑起来......挺难看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起来你精神不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我给你带了一碗肉汤，喝下去会好些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不了......别人更需要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"谢......谢谢来看我，也谢谢你当时......救我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我一直想问......你为什么救我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"四处游历的时候，有很多次......我也以为自己要死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但很幸运，每次都能碰上好心肠的人，我知道等待死亡是什么感受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那并不好受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"原来......咳，我、我都不怎么了解你，多讲......讲其他，我想听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的......家乡，有吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有家乡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你总有家庭吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有亲人，父母很早就离开了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......这样啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那小子，你和他讲讲，你这一身本事都是在哪里学到的，行吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾经，有些人看我孑然一身，教给我几样谋生的手段，所以杂七杂八学了不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有一位老师，剑术就是他传授给我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们在一起生活过很久，我从他身上学到很多有用的技能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他一定花过不少心思在你身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，他视我为接班人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那......你为什么......不留下来......和他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我过不了那样的日子，他让我觉得安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"安全......不好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"觉得自己安全不是什么好事，会令人放松警惕。可世上没有地方是绝对安全的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"知道吗......老兄，我觉得......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你没家......四处流浪，不喜欢安逸......常与危险......咳咳......动荡为伍。你简直......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你简直就是个......天生的海盗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......或许。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"伊西多没再说话，那碗汤在盐漠寒冷的夜风中已经被吹得冰凉。\n于是他将碗凑在嘴边，轻轻啜饮，经过一个月，他早已习惯它咸重的味道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
